      "section": "2. General Safety Precautions",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.16,
        "t": 742.45466,
        "r": 527.1362159999998,
        "b": 716.5429289281768
      },
      "content": "When temporarily stopping a work and leaving the machine, first switch off the Operating Panel and then the main power."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0129",
      "reading_order": 144,
      "section": "2. General Safety Precautions",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.16,
        "t": 521.4154640000002,
        "r": 527.1261959999987,
        "b": 495.56385292817697
      },
      "content": "When finishing a daily work and leaving the machine, switch off the Operating Panel, the main power switch, and then the power supply switch at factory."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0130",
      "reading_order": 145,
      "section": "2. General Safety Precautions",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.15999999999997,
        "t": 300.4363880000002,
        "r": 527.1292019999992,
        "b": 274.584776928177
      },
      "content": "It is dangerous to operate the machine when being operated or repaired by the other worker. Be careful when more than two people have to work together."
    },
